{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7502c304a3a96f72076363f752243017a0223f2b5fe196b6ff877d0456eb07b8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3b58fe76856cba20a5389be46cd128cd6db9b21a04736edc1cca0d3a565bd9e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6084d012152900bce1930852baf653757a590c874223a74a142a4bf5db4d901f",
      "text": "之前我说要去做调查的，\n关于这次游戏的……咳咳。是工作上的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3222ca6525338a5f943893c97a39ac6d2c702007672d272296228e4f4b1e9710",
      "text": "我找到了挺多感觉用得上的参考资料，\n稍后发邮件给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b2ba1811e66eef3e01a48e589b379c48c9efa25b3a8354c7e883e04351ba73",
      "text": "非常感谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28c97c5382353ccfa6dae17e7133f4406687f7fc039192fdd37e072807cf3d0e",
      "text": "道谢就免了，这种小事轻轻松松啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55070e21e4db69ffe52fe9941f0f5b4d5a2b05bcfbab42f6a3b47fa990529b1b",
      "text": "然后现在，我正让前辈们\n试玩那款游戏……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b059179e6928cfb550d2836fcb56022e3b04f73c496fb58ea5eb15559fd173",
      "text": "两个人的领悟力都很高，水平正以惊人的速度提升。\n你要是看了肯定会大吃一惊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6b9460914c5c2d3e73593df1f34072ed31c3578b29bad47988f7a4229fb3ef6",
      "text": "等再练上一阵子，找个机会让你瞧瞧。\n啊，到了活动现场，应该也可以聊这个话题吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:047shu_402_2_4_047_02_09_c:2_4_047_02_09_c:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a16266e0f3a53374bba8138fc29739eb3129a7b5f16eb38415d2a90bc73e8b6",
      "text": "那我准备发资料了，先挂断了。\n要是有什么觉得在意的点就联系我。回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
